WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.500
[Ambient electronic music]

00:07.500 --> 00:16.300
[Crystal sweep; the music opens]

00:16.300 --> 00:26.500
[A low pulse and restrained beat enter]

00:26.500 --> 00:35.800
[The pulse softens]

00:35.800 --> 00:45.700
[The beat builds with the concurrent workstreams]

00:45.700 --> 00:55.900
[Electronic shutter; a deeper pulse marks execution]

00:55.900 --> 01:04.600
[The rhythm recedes]

01:04.600 --> 01:14.000
[A final crystal sweep resolves into silence]
